	3423 [label="Within me is a malestrom of a rabid beast, eating away at my ribcage from the inside out.",shape=box,color=blue];
		3423 -> 3454;
	3424 [label="And the simple fact of the matter is? You are one of the very few Orokin we know that survived the Night of the Naga drums. From my point of view? It was a strategic retreat.",shape=box,color=red];
		3424 -> 3455;
	3425 [label="That is the only thing that defines you, now. You can change. And you can change the world around you. I guess my only question is, will you at least try?",shape=box,color=red];
